  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.25,
      "e": 2.84,
      "text": "(upbeat music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 5.89,
      "e": 6.72,
      "text": "- Here at Farrier,"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.72,
      "e": 10.27,
      "text": "we try to give as much realistic training as possible"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.27,
      "e": 12.77,
      "text": "to the fleet by using Buttercup,"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.77,
      "e": 14.49,
      "text": "using live fires,"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.49,
      "e": 16.74,
      "text": "try to get people used to"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.74,
      "e": 19.41,
      "text": "fighting real casualties, as close as possible,"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.41,
      "e": 21.46,
      "text": "and keeping it safe as possible."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.46,
      "e": 22.54,
      "text": "So we can do multiple things"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.54,
      "e": 25.41,
      "text": "from fires to flooding training,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.41,
      "e": 27.98,
      "text": "to dewatering, anything that we could do"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.98,
      "e": 29.5,
      "text": "that could possibly happen on shift,"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.5,
      "e": 30.4,
      "text": "we train for here."
    },
    {
      "s": 31.52,
      "e": 33.81,
      "text": "Real life training is probably the most"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.81,
      "e": 35.45,
      "text": "important thing that we could do in a meeting"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.45,
      "e": 37.1,
      "text": "because it's all about reps and sets."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.1,
      "e": 38.73,
      "text": "It's all about building that muscle memory."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.73,
      "e": 39.77,
      "text": "The more they can do it,"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.77,
      "e": 41.62,
      "text": "the more they can be stressed out,"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.62,
      "e": 43.9,
      "text": "the more comfortable they are in that situation"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.9,
      "e": 46.2,
      "text": "when something does happen"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.2,
      "e": 47.27,
      "text": "because we all know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.27,
      "e": 48.55,
      "text": "when a casualty happens,"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.55,
      "e": 50.32,
      "text": "first thing that shuts off is your brain."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.32,
      "e": 52.73,
      "text": "Then all you really have left is that muscle memory."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.73,
      "e": 55.51,
      "text": "So it's good for them to get here in a realistic job"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.51,
      "e": 56.74,
      "text": "and a safe environment,"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.74,
      "e": 58.63,
      "text": "so that they can get those reps and sets,"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.63,
      "e": 60.88,
      "text": "so they're better prepared when they do get to the ship"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.88,
      "e": 62.18,
      "text": "and something bad happens."
    },
    {
      "s": 66.07,
      "e": 67.4,
      "text": "When we're out at sea,"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.4,
      "e": 68.31,
      "text": "we don't have 911."
    },
    {
      "s": 68.31,
      "e": 70.03,
      "text": "We don't have anybody we can fall back on."
    },
    {
      "s": 70.03,
      "e": 71.1,
      "text": "We're all we got."
    },
    {
      "s": 71.1,
      "e": 72.06,
      "text": "It's not everybody rate."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.06,
      "e": 73.83,
      "text": "That's not what they came in the Navy for,"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.83,
      "e": 75.9,
      "text": "but when it comes down to emergencies,"
    },
    {
      "s": 75.9,
      "e": 76.86,
      "text": "we need everybody."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.86,
      "e": 78.57,
      "text": "We need all hands on deck"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.57,
      "e": 79.75,
      "text": "to get through the casualty."
    },
    {
      "s": 79.75,
      "e": 81.93,
      "text": "So I'm gonna need you to help me fight"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.93,
      "e": 83.02,
      "text": "with our brothers and sisters"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.02,
      "e": 85.38,
      "text": "so that we can get the ship back to a safe environment"
    },
    {
      "s": 85.38,
      "e": 87.28,
      "text": "so that you can get home to your loved ones"
    },
    {
      "s": 87.28,
      "e": 89.54,
      "text": "and get back to doing what you love to do."
    }
